
== 1. every row latte.pot has ==
ok 1.1 name
ok 1.2 target
ok 1.3 version
ok 1.4 markup
ok 1.5 a quoted title
ok 1.6 fonts
ok 1.7 the debug profile's out
ok 1.8 the release profile's out
ok 1.9 lto belongs to the profile above it
ok 1.10 and not to the other one
ok 1.11 a trailing comment is not part of the value
ok 1.12 a # inside a quote is
ok 1.13 an empty manifest is html
ok 1.14 with the two default profiles

== 2. what it refuses ==
ok 2.1 an unknown row
ok 2.2 a target that is not one
ok 2.3 a row with no value
ok 2.4 a row with two
ok 2.5 a profile row outside a profile
ok 2.6 a third profile
ok 2.7 lto that is not a flag
ok 2.8 the same markup folder twice
ok 2.9 the same font twice
ok 2.10 a quote nobody closed
ok 2.11 a top-level row closes the profile above it

== 3. where a generated file goes ==
ok 3.1 one folder deep
ok 3.2 and deeper
ok 3.3 a file at the root

== 4. the beansc command line ==
ok 4.1 html, debug
ok 4.2 html, release
ok 4.3 canvas, debug
ok 4.4 canvas, release, lto
ok 4.7 canvas, with a wasm-ld that is not on PATH
ok 4.8 an html build never takes the linker
ok 4.9 a browser bundle, release, with a linker
ok 4.5 an unnamed project is called after its module
ok 4.6 and a named one after its name

== 5. a name that can be a module ==
ok 5.1 a word
ok 5.2 with an underscore and a digit
ok 5.3 starting with a digit
ok 5.4 with a dash
ok 5.5 with a dot
ok 5.6 nothing at all

== 6. the page a canvas build writes ==
ok 6.1 the title is the manifest's name
ok 6.2 the module is named by the build
ok 6.3 every staged font is registered
ok 6.4 the stylesheet sizes the canvas
ok 6.5 every path in it is relative, so it serves under any prefix
ok 6.6 a title with markup characters is escaped

== 7. pins ==
ok 7.1 the latte row's ref, not the commented one
ok 7.2 a quoted ref loses its quotes
ok 7.3 a remote nobody requires
ok 7.4 path rows, relative and absolute, against the project
ok 7.5 the rows that move, and only those
ok 7.6 the moved text keeps comments, quotes and spacing
ok 7.7 and moving it again moves nothing
ok 7.8 a project on a checkout by path has no pin to move

== 8. where a canvas page comes from ==
ok 8.1 a checkout's three folders
ok 8.2 an installation's three folders
ok 8.3 a pin this latte's kit serves
ok 8.4 a pin to another latte is refused, and says how to move
ok 8.5 a pin that is not a version tag is refused too
ok 8.6 no installation at all
ok 8.7 an installation whose kit does not say its version
ok 8.8 a VERSION file's fields

== 9. doctor ==
ok 9.1 a newer patch
ok 9.2 the floor itself
ok 9.3 an older one
ok 9.4 three digits beat two
ok 9.5 a minor that moves
ok 9.6 a major that is behind
ok 9.7 beansc's answer
ok 9.8 something that is not beansc
ok 9.9 an installed kit holds its stamp, the page, CanvasKit and the fonts
